Nightshift shows Codex the way the Codex CLI does.

hooks/codex-frames.ts is generated by running the Codex CLI's own logo
renderer, ported line for line from
  codex-rs/tui/src/empty_state_animation/{paths,geometry,renderer,lighting,sequence}.rs
at 20 columns by 7 rows. hooks/look.ts follows the working-line shimmer of
  codex-rs/tui/src/status_indicator_widget/summary_shimmer.rs and motion.rs,
and the reply header uses the ">_" mark of codex-rs/tui/src/history_cell/session.rs.

